Package: qeviz
Title: Interactive ENA / ONA Network Visualizations
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: person("Cody", "Marquart", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "cody.marquart@wisc.edu")
Description: Generates interactive Epistemic Network Analysis (ENA) and
    Ordered Network Analysis (ONA) visualizations using the qeviz web
    component library. Provides helpers to convert rENA / tma model
    objects into the qeviz ModelData format and render them as
    self-contained HTML files or inline plots.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
